---
const target = "/";
---

<!doctype html>
<html lang="ko">
	<head>
		<meta charset="utf-8" />
		<meta http-equiv="refresh" content="0;url=/" />
		<link rel="canonical" href="https://sendoru.github.io/" />
		<meta name="robots" content="noindex" />
		<title>Redirecting…</title>
		<script is:inline>
			window.location.replace("/");
		</script>
	</head>
	<body>
		<p>새 블로그 주소로 이동합니다. <a href={target}>계속하기</a></p>
	</body>
</html>
